  "description": "To survive as someone from a lowly background I, as a doctor, had to abandon my pride If I had to bark, I barked, if I had to beg, I beggedIs this the outcome of the weak?!When frustration and anger brimmed in both eyes Facing death in a traffic accident, But when I opened my eyes again, I found myself back as an intern…!On the outside, a novice doctor in their 20s, but on the inside, a top-tier thoracic surgeon.The revenge and healing drama of Max Level Doctor Kim Yoon Chan begins.‘From now on, I will take control of every situation!’\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
